# No dependency needs an install script: better-sqlite3 ships N-API prebuilds
# and esbuild/rolldown/tailwind use prebuilt platform packages. npm 11 would
# otherwise ask to approve a node-gyp rebuild and an esbuild postinstall on
# every install. Skipping scripts keeps `npm install` quiet, toolchain-free,
# and free of third-party install-time code (ADR 0001).
ignore-scripts=true
